# What `railway up` must not upload.
#
# `sources/` is deliberately NOT here: it holds the public NPC and open-data
# documents the seed ingests, and the Organisation re-sync diff reads one file
# from it at runtime. It is about 250 MB, so a CLI deploy carries it and a
# GitHub deploy does not (it is in .gitignore). Neither is fatal: the supported
# way to put data in front of this app is the bundle restored by scripts/boot.mjs.

